corrective_actions:
In summary, the lessons learned from this event reinforce the need to:
• Expand the consideration of human factors in all phases of the operational cycle;
• Improve communication and reporting mechanisms, encouraging the active participation of workers;
Safety performance indicators – Process safety events – 2025 data
109

